@startuml
title SSE Stream Routes

actor Client
participant "SseController" as Resource
participant "SSE" as SSE

== GET /api/{uuid}/stream ==
Client -> Resource: GET /api/{uuid}/stream
activate Resource
Resource -> SSE: subscribe()
activate SSE
SSE --> Resource: SseEmitter
deactivate SSE
Resource --> Client: 200 OK (Content-Type: text/event-stream)
deactivate Resource
@enduml
